  "title": "Moist Slow Cooker Roast Beef Without Vegetables",
  "description": "This easy, moist slow cooker roast beef without vegetables simmers in a full-flavored gravy made with onion soup mix, Worcestershire, and soy sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Tannis"
  ],
